	<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1"> <b>An Apology</b></font>
	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2">I post here on the CoN forums to give a sincere apology to Trompen, those who worked hard on camping his epic, and CoN as a whole. On Friday, I logged at approximetly 9:30 AM Pst and within ten minutes I made the decision to engage Ragefire. The decision was ultimately mine and no one elses. The members there and the eighty others who have a Spirit of Tunare tag above there head were going on what I said, just as they have for the 30 months the guild has been on the Rathe. For them to hold any responsibility is wrong, and the fault is mine solely. Furthermore the continuous harassing tells they are getting, many who were not even online at the time need to stop. Nevertheless, the action has been done and the bad decision must be amended as best as it can at this point. SoT, including myself, will aid in the camping and slaying of Ragefire until Trompen has his epic at the least. I will also sit down with CoN leadership, which I assume is Derek and Massvalour as I talked with previouslly, to finish discussions on this incident. Best of luck with your future endeavors, and again I apologize for the terrible mistake I made.<br />
<br />
-Shei Noktaurus<br />
GM<br />
Spirit of Tunare</font></p>
	
